<title>USA: NYSE closing averages.</title>
<headline>NYSE closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the New York Stock Exchange closed sharply lower in fairly heavy trading Tuesday.</p>
<p>The Dow Jones industrial average fell 101.10 points to 6,448.27. For the year, the Dow industrials rose 1,331.15 points.</p>
<p>The NYSE Composite fell 5.12 to 392.30.</p>
<p>The average price per share fell 53 cents.</p>
<p>Winners beat losers 1,283 to 1,237.</p>
<p>Volume was 395.2 million shares, compared with 339 million shares on Monday.</p>
